---
config:
  theme: mc
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant View as Profile/Index.cshtml<br/>(GUI-BRAP)
    participant WebCtrl as ProfileController<br/>(GUI-BRAP)
    participant Proxy as AccountProxyService<br/>(GUI-BRAP)
    participant ApiClient as IAccountService<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.ApiClient)
    participant ApiCtrl as AccountController<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.Api)
    participant ApiSvc as AccountService<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.Api)
    participant Mapper as AccountProfileMapper<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.Api)
    participant Repo as AccountRepository<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.Api)
    participant DbContext as AppDbContext<br/>(BoardRentAndProperty.Api)
    participant SQL as SQL Server

    User->>View: submit form (Profile data)
    activate View
    
    View->>WebCtrl: POST /Profile/Index (ProfileViewModel)
    activate WebCtrl
    
    Note over WebCtrl: ModelState.IsValid check
    
    WebCtrl->>Proxy: UpdateProfileAsync(currentUserId, updateData)
    activate Proxy
    
    Proxy->>ApiClient: UpdateProfileAsync(accountId, profileUpdateData)
    activate ApiClient
    
    ApiClient->>ApiCtrl: HTTP PUT /api/accounts/{id}
    activate ApiCtrl
    
    ApiCtrl->>ApiSvc: UpdateProfileAsync(accountId, profileUpdateData)
    activate ApiSvc
    
    Note over ApiSvc: Fetch existing account entity first
    
    ApiSvc->>Repo: GetByIdAsync(accountId)
    activate Repo
    
    Repo->>DbContext: Accounts.Include(a => a.Roles).FirstOrDefaultAsync()
    activate DbContext
    
    DbContext->>SQL: SELECT * FROM Accounts WHERE Id = accountId
    activate SQL
    SQL-->>DbContext: result row
    deactivate SQL
    
    DbContext-->>Repo: Account entity
    deactivate DbContext
    
    Repo-->>ApiSvc: accountEntity
    deactivate Repo
    
    Note over ApiSvc: ValidateProfileDetails(profileUpdateData)<br/>Check for duplicate Email
    
    ApiSvc->>Mapper: ApplyToEntity(accountEntity, profileUpdateData)
    activate Mapper
    Mapper-->>ApiSvc: updated accountEntity properties
    deactivate Mapper
    
    ApiSvc->>Repo: UpdateAsync(accountEntity)
    activate Repo
    
    Repo->>DbContext: SaveChangesAsync()
    activate DbContext
    
    DbContext->>SQL: UPDATE Accounts SET DisplayName, Email, etc.
    activate SQL
    SQL-->>DbContext: rows affected
    deactivate SQL
    
    DbContext-->>Repo: saved
    deactivate DbContext
    
    Repo-->>ApiSvc: Task Completed
    deactivate Repo
    
    ApiSvc-->>ApiCtrl: ServiceResult<bool>.Ok(true)
    deactivate ApiSvc
    
    ApiCtrl-->>ApiClient: HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate ApiCtrl
    
    ApiClient-->>Proxy: ServiceResult
    deactivate ApiClient
    
    Proxy-->>WebCtrl: Task Completed
    deactivate Proxy
    
    Note over WebCtrl: TempData["SuccessMessage"] =<br/>"Profile updated successfully."
    
    WebCtrl-->>View: RedirectToAction(nameof(Index))
    deactivate WebCtrl
    
    View-->>User: Render page with success message
    deactivate View
